---
import Highlight from '../../layouts/Highlight.astro';
---

<Highlight slug="seo" lede="A booking platform in 84+ locales only works if search engines understand every version of every page. I worked on the plumbing that makes that happen.">
	<section style="padding-top: 64px">
		<h2 class="lbl">What I did</h2>
		<ul class="bl">
			<li><span><b>Sitemaps rebuilt</b> around canonical URLs — from about 1.4 million entries down to about 19 thousand — which also stopped crawlers from overloading the servers.</span></li>
			<li><span><b>hreflang validated</b> across 84 locales, so each language version points to the right siblings.</span></li>
			<li><span><b>Structured data</b> for hotels and vacation rentals audited and fixed, including a security issue in how it was embedded.</span></li>
			<li><span><b>An SEO audit tool</b> to catch these problems automatically.</span></li>
		</ul>
	</section>
	<section style="padding-top: 64px">
		<h2 class="lbl">Results</h2>
		<div class="stat">
			<div><span class="n">1.4M → 19K</span><span class="l">sitemap URLs</span></div>
			<div><span class="n">84</span><span class="l">locales validated</span></div>
			<div><span class="n">[X]</span><span class="l">[METRIC — e.g. indexed pages]</span></div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Highlight>
